        "TileImage": "$($repository 37404add-fbf0-4698-9712-50ced4f4b46c).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47.\r\rThis one is different. We have three targets inside the New York bank. The first two are known only by their codenames, Sugar Squirrel and Gourd. They’re wanted for a series of bank robberies across the country. But they couldn’t have done it alone. Their inside man is Linwood Klass, a bank employee who has been feeding them confidential information, schedules and security details for months. Sugar Squirrel and Gourd are currently inside the bank. \r\rGood Luck 47.",
